Patients residing in any part of the State, however distant, who may desire the opinion and advice of DR. Doherty in their respective cases, and who think proper to submit written statement on such, in preference to holding personal interview, are respectfully assured that their communication will be held most sacred and confidential.

If the case be fully and candidly described, personal communication will be unnecessary, as instructions for Diet regimen, and the general treatment of the case (including the remedies), will be forwarded without delay, and in such manner as to convey no idea of the purport of the letter also transmitted. Consultation by letter or otherwise. PRICE. Permanent cure guaranteed or no pay. Address, W. X. DOHERTY, N. D.

San Francisco, California;

